# WordFlow AI Rule (qy_capacitor)

`poly_apps/qy_capacitor` = WordFlow AI frontend (React/TSX + Vite + Capacitor); backend = AppQyV1 in `poly_apps/laravel_main`.

- **Co-development (强制).** A feature change must land frontend AND its backend together: `laravel_main/app/Apps/AppQyV1/**` + `routes/AppQyV1Router/**`. A new/changed API call without its route+controller (or vice versa) is incomplete.
- **Base > personalized (基类>个性化).** Apply `ds-*` base classes/Design Tokens first, then personalize. Never bypass tokens (`index.css` :root/html.dark, `StyleCenter.ts`) for one-off inline styles. No ad-hoc colors (e.g. `bg-blue-600`); solid `--klein-*` for text/icons/active, gradient `--klein-grad-*` for hero surfaces only.
- **Parity gate (强制).** Before any visible design change, Read both `public/design-reference-light.webp` + `…-dark.webp` and match them; dark/light parity is acceptance criteria.
- **Reuse primitives.** Consume `components/UI.tsx` (Button variants, SectionTitle, IconTile, FabGrad, BentoTile, Popover/Portal/Sheet, Icons.*); re-implementing inline is a defect. Icons: `Icons.*` then `lucide-react` only, never emoji-as-icon. Use centralized z-scale (`.ds-z-*`), never hand-rolled `absolute z-50`.

Full detail: `poly_apps/pycore_laravel_wordflow_ui/apps/wordflow/docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`. Per-app conventions: `poly_apps/qy_capacitor/CLAUDE.md`.
